 'privacy-policy'=>['Privacy Policy','<h2>Development preview privacy notice</h2><p>This store uses the information you submit to provide account access, saved addresses, shopping cart sessions, order tracking and signup discount codes. Language and market preferences may be stored in cookies. Guest wishlist items are stored in your browser; signed-in wishlists are saved to your account.</p><p>Submitting the signup form records your email with an email-restricted coupon and attempts to send the code. Marketing platform synchronization is not enabled.</p><p>The final business identity, contact details, retention periods and privacy terms will be published before commercial launch.</p>'],
 'terms-and-conditions'=>['Terms and Conditions','<p>This store is a development preview. Live payment processing is not available. Prices, product information, availability and shipping settings are used for testing and may change.</p><p>Final terms of sale, business information and customer service policies will be published before commercial launch.</p>'],
